OL,3,GNEWSATwo festivals get permission to
OL,4,Aincrease numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo music events in Cornwall have
OL,7,Freceived permission from councillors to
OL,8,Fincrease attendance by thousands.
OL,10,FA Cornwall Council licensing committee
OL,11,Fagreed to the increase for The Great
OL,12,FEstate and Live at Scorrier House next
OL,13,Fyear, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,14,FService said.
OL,16,FBoth annual festivals take place within
OL,17,Fthe grounds of Scorrier House between
OL,18,FTruro and Redruth.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
